      {
        "id": "1lEgWRFYh9E68mEE",
        "title": "Investigating",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>By now you have a first prototype of a prosthesis, you have figured out how to make an automatic machine, and you have figured out how to make a servo work.</p><p>Today, you&#x27;ll figure out how to connect your prosthesis to a servo so that it makes motions automatically.</p>"
          ]
        }
      },
